# Line endings: the repo is authored on Linux (WSL) and built on Windows.
# Everything checked out must be LF, on both filesystems, so `git status` stays
# honest and MSVC/rustc receive the same bytes as CI.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never converted, never diffed as text. `*.bin` and `*.jwt` are
# test fixtures (IPP captures, entitlement tokens); the REA corpus is PDF/PNG.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.bin binary
*.jwt binary
*.p12 binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
